item.scroll_ender.name=Ender Scroll
item.scroll_ender.desc=Fires an ender-colored magic bolt; on impact, teleports you to the hit position and deals 5 fall damage.
item.scroll_life_drain.name=Life Drain Scroll
item.scroll_life_drain.desc=Creates a life-drain orb above your head for 10 seconds; other creatures within 5 blocks lose 4 health per second and you heal 2 health per second.
item.scroll_sky_strike.name=Super-Tier Magic - Heaven's Judgment
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc=A super-tier spell sealed in a blank scroll. Right-click to fire a fast magic projectile.
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc.1=On hitting a block, an entity, or after 96 blocks, multiple judgment arrays unfold at the impact point.
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc.2=The main array has a 48-block radius and sits at the world ceiling at the top of the beam; destruction and damage are limited to a 16-block diameter. After charging, a 16-block-diameter beam descends all the way to the bedrock layer and the final attack lasts 30 seconds.
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc.3=Each second, creatures in range lose 1/5 of their max health directly and take 300 armor-piercing absolute magic damage. Blocks with hardness -1 survive.
item.scroll_heaven_strike.name=Super-Tier Magic - Sky Strike
item.scroll_heaven_strike.desc=Right-click to designate a surface point. A deep-purple array unfolds there, growing from a tiny circle to its full size.
item.scroll_heaven_strike.desc.1=A rippling purple energy sphere gathers above the cloud layer. At a radius of 64 blocks the array dissolves, the sphere stretches into an ellipsoid and slams down.
item.scroll_heaven_strike.desc.2=The blast destroys every block with hardness >= 0 inside a 96-block radius. Creatures in range take 768 magic damage and 256 direct set-health damage, and are set on fire.
item.scroll_heaven_strike.desc.3=Damage then repeats once per second at 2/3 of the previous value, with at least 102.4 (10% of the total) guaranteed as true damage.
item.scroll_magic_cannon.name=Magic - Magic Cannon
item.scroll_magic_cannon.desc=Hold the blank scroll to charge; arrays appear in front of the caster and under their feet, then fire a magic cannon after about 3 seconds.
item.scroll_magic_cannon.desc.1=The beam has a 2-block radius and a maximum length of 128 blocks, and destroys blocks with blast resistance below 20.
item.scroll_magic_cannon.desc.2=The beam lasts 5 seconds; creatures in range take 30 armor-piercing absolute magic damage every second.
item.scroll_guardian_beam.name=Magic - Guardian Beam
item.scroll_guardian_beam.desc=Launches a thin, fast blue-white beam.
item.scroll_guardian_beam.desc.1=It explodes on impact and ignites the target and nearby blocks.
item.scroll_silent_rain.name=Super-tier Magic - Silent Rain
item.scroll_silent_rain.desc=Creates a 64-block-radius array at cloud height for 60 seconds, or at the world ceiling where no clouds exist.
item.scroll_silent_rain.desc.1=Magic rain falls once it forms; each creature in range has a 25% chance to take 1-100 random magic damage every second.
item.scroll_silent_rain.desc.2=The array does not alter terrain.
item.scroll_god_wrath.name=Super-tier Magic - Wrath of God
item.scroll_god_wrath.desc=Spreads 36 small arrays at cloud height, or at the world ceiling where no clouds exist.
item.scroll_god_wrath.desc.1=Each array attacks the nearest creature within 128 horizontal blocks every 3-5 seconds for 20 magic damage, up to 10 attacks.
item.scroll_god_wrath.desc.2=An array dissipates immediately after its attacks are exhausted; otherwise it lasts at most (5 + remaining attacks) x 60 seconds. Arrays do not alter terrain.
item.scroll_nuclear_strike.name=Super-tier Magic - Nuclear Strike
item.scroll_nuclear_strike.desc=Right-click to designate a point up to 384 blocks away; a star core descends after 6 seconds. If no block is hit, it detonates at the endpoint, using the surface or an airburst.
item.scroll_nuclear_strike.desc.1=Core radius 40: removes 60% max health and deals 1000 absolute magic damage. Ground blast radius 192; airburst radius 224.
item.scroll_nuclear_strike.desc.2=Leaves an 88-block-radius destruction zone extending about 64 blocks above and below the impact, carved over multiple ticks, and a 160-block-radius radiation field for 30 seconds. Blocks with hardness -1 survive.
item.scroll_nuclear_strike.desc.3=The caster also suffers the blast, knockback, fire and radiation.
item.scroll_black_hole.name=Magic - Black Hole
item.scroll_black_hole.desc=Right-click to launch the legacy Black Hole: radius 3, speed 0.75, about 20 seconds of lifetime.
item.scroll_black_hole.desc.1=The Black Hole keeps breaking blocks in a sphere and pulls/damages nearby entities. The caster is not harmed.
item.scroll_black_hole.desc.2=The scroll only configures the existing entity and spawns it; the Black Hole logic is unchanged.
item.scroll_destroy_sphere.name=Magic - Destruction Sphere
item.scroll_destroy_sphere.desc=Right-click to launch the legacy Destruction Sphere: radius 3, speed 0.75, about 20 seconds of lifetime.
item.scroll_destroy_sphere.desc.1=The Destruction Sphere only performs spherical destruction and damage. The caster is not harmed.
item.scroll_destroy_sphere.desc.2=The scroll only configures the existing entity and spawns it; the Destruction Sphere logic is unchanged.

